# landmark (assets/world3d/cliffs/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Gullible Cliffs: the counterweight goat lift's timber derrick on its plot, a hilltop chapel with its bell-cote on the north-east wall.
# the derrick: four legs, braces, a top frame with two pulleys, a counterweight and a basket on their ropes, a jib out over the road
